<h3 dir="auto" data-start="925" data-end="944">Why we need IDD</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="946" data-end="1032">Your IDD subset gives you <strong data-start="972" data-end="1020">real Indian-road images with labeled objects</strong>, including:</p>
<ul data-start="1034" data-end="1155">
<li data-start="1034" data-end="1042">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1036" data-end="1042">animal</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1043" data-end="1057">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1045" data-end="1057">autorickshaw</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1058" data-end="1067">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1060" data-end="1067">bicycle</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1068" data-end="1073">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1070" data-end="1073">bus</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1074" data-end="1079">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1076" data-end="1079">car</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1080" data-end="1092">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1082" data-end="1092">motorcycle</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1093" data-end="1101">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1095" data-end="1101">person</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1102" data-end="1109">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1104" data-end="1109">rider</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1110" data-end="1125">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1112" data-end="1125">traffic light</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1126" data-end="1140">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1128" data-end="1140">traffic sign</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1141" data-end="1148">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1143" data-end="1148">truck</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1149" data-end="1155">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1151" data-end="1155">etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1157" data-end="1267">That is excellent for training your object detector to recognize the <strong data-start="1226" data-end="1250">Indian mixed traffic</strong> in your problem.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="1269" data-end="1295">Why we need RoadRunner</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1297" data-end="1352">RoadRunner lets us create controlled scenarios such as:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1354" data-end="1484"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-ba6869f7.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>🐄 Cattle crossing
🚶 Sudden pedestrian
🛺 Auto-rickshaw
🚗 Informal merging
🏪 Dense market
🛣️ Unmarked village road</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1486" data-end="1582">Then we can eventually test whether your perception system works on simulated camera/LiDAR data.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="1584" data-end="1612">So don't delete anything</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1614" data-end="1647">You have already completed a lot:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1649" data-end="1756"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-ba6869f7.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>IDD subset
├── train → 2000 images + labels ✅
├── val   → 300 images + labels ✅
└── data.yaml ✅</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1758" data-end="1805">And MATLAB has successfully verified all of it.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1807" data-end="1829"><strong data-start="1807" data-end="1829">Keep this dataset.</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1831" data-end="1980">The next step is still our <strong data-start="1858" data-end="1906">MATLAB object-detection training preparation</strong>. RoadRunner will come into the workflow afterward for simulation/testing.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1982" data-end="2181" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">One important distinction: <strong data-start="2009" data-end="2087">RoadRunner does not replace the need for a trained object-detection model.</strong> It provides the environment/sensor data; your model is what detects the objects in that data.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.